Package: mavair
Title: Reference Statistical Computations for the mavai Project Family
Version: 0.11.2
Authors@R: person("mavai-org", email = "info@mavai.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates language-agnostic reference datasets for statistical
    computations used in probabilistic testing frameworks. Provides canonical
    expected outputs — computed in R using established statistical packages — so
    that implementations in Java (punit), Rust (feotest), Python (baseltest),
    and future languages can verify conformance. Covers the Statistical
    Companion 1.5.0 decision rules (the one-sided Fisher exact test for
    empirical regression, the exact binomial test for normative
    compliance, the precedence rank for latency), their configuration errors,
    exact power and sizing, Wilson score intervals as descriptive primitives,
    and verdict evaluation, with calibration certification over the operating
    envelope. Designed to grow into design of experiments (DoE)
    reference data as the mavai family expands.
License: Apache-2.0
